Domain Entity EducationContent
    documentation 'This entity represents materials for students or teachers that can be used for 
                  'teaching, learning, research, and more. Education content includes full courses, 
                  'course materials, modules, intervention descriptions, textbooks, streaming 
                  'videos, tests, software, and any other tools, materials, or techniques used to 
                  'support access to knowledge.
    string ContentIdentifier
        documentation 'A unique identifier for the EducationContent.
        is part of identity
        min length 1
        max length 225
    include LearningResourceContentChoice
        documentation 'NEEDS DOCUMENTATION
        is required
    currency Cost
        documentation 'An amount that has to be paid or spent to buy or obtain the EducationContent.
        is optional
    enumeration CostRate
        documentation 'The rate by which the cost applies.
        is optional
    shared string URI named Namespace
        documentation 'Namespace for the EducationContent.
        is required
